title: Sport Walkman Logger
id: deck-audition
tab: 00 · Deck Audition
about: 90s Yellow Sport Walkman v3 logger Deck battles tape jams and binder-clip takes with stage-manager owl Tally
lead: deck
key: D minor
bpm: 112
backing:
bass: none
stage: deck, tally
registers: deck -12, tally 0
breath: .5
finale: "Lock" on 0

[verse 1]
deck: "Yellow sport shell clips on the beat" = 0 2 3 5 4 3/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 | I 4, V 4 ; do nod ; move left 4 ; cam wide
tally: "Red lamp blinks sharp, keep deck roll neat" = 4 5 7 5 4 3/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 | IV 4, I 4 ; do tilt ; move right 4 ; cam two-shot
deck: "Walkman three logs right down the floor" = 0 2/.5 3/.5 5/.5 4/.5 3/.5 2/.5 0/3.5 | I 4, IV 4 ; do laugh ; take logging-clip ; cam closeup
tally: "Take four oh four!" = 4 2/.5 1/.5 0/1.5 | IV 4
tally: "White ticker curls right past the score!" = 4 5/.5 5/.5 7/2 5 4/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 | IV 4, V 4 ; do cheer ; take ticker-cue ; cam reaction

[chorus]
deck: "Snap that yellow lid, roll four oh four!" = 0/.5 2/.5 3/.5 4/.5 5/2 4 3/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 | I 4, IV 4 ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; cam low-angle
tally: "Log that cue!" = 7 5 4/1.5 | IV 4 ; jump 1.5
