deck: "Keep rolling!" = 0 2 0/1.5 | I 4 ; dance 4

[bridge]
deck: "The cassette just chewed up the spool!" = 1 2 3 0/.5 -1/.5 0 2 0/1.5 | V 4, VI 4 ; do gasp ; take tape-jam ; move right 4 ; cam reaction
rest 2
tally: "Wait! Wind it fast, stay smooth and cool!" = 5 4 2/.5 3/1.5 4 5/.5 4/.5 2/1.5 | IV 4, V 4 ; do laugh ; move left 4 ; cam two-shot
deck: "Binder clip locked, we're back in stride!" = 0 2 3 5/.5 4/.5 3 2/.5 0/2 | I 4, V 4 ; do cheer ; move center 4 ; cam closeup
tally: "Back in stride!" = 5 4 2/1.5 | V 4 ; move center 4

[repeat chorus]

[curtain call]
deck: "Clip the last take and bow down low" = 0 2 3 5/.5 4/.5 2 1/.5 0/2 | I 4, V 4 ; do bow ; celebrate 4 ; cam wide
tally: "Hoot! Bow low!" = 4 2 0/1.5 | I 4 ; do bow ; celebrate 2
